        "liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n  =====================================================================\n  MIRROR — \"Browse more mirrors\" carousel  (paste into a Liquid block)\n  Pulls from one collection. CSS scroll carousel (no JS needed).\n  Current product is auto-excluded. Edit the handle + heading below.\n  =====================================================================\n{%- endcomment -%}\n\n{%- assign source_handle = 'led-mirrors' -%}\n{%- assign heading = 'Browse more mirrors' -%}\n\n{%- assign coll = collections[source_handle] -%}\n{%- assign current_handle = product.handle -%}\n\n{%- if coll != blank and coll.products_count > 0 -%}\n<style>\n  .mcaro{font-family:\"Roboto\",sans-serif;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto}\n  .mcaro__h{font-family:\"Fraunces\",serif;font-weight:700;font-size:30px;color:#016FD0;margin:0 0 18px}\n  .mcaro__track{display:flex;gap:16px;overflow-x:auto;padding:4px 4px 14px;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch}\n  .mcaro__track::-webkit-scrollbar{height:6px}\n  .mcaro__track::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:#cfd6dd;border-radius:6px}\n  .mcaro__card{flex:0 0 220px;scroll-snap-align:start;border:2px solid #e6e8eb;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff;text-decoration:none;color:#1a1d24;transition:border-color .15s}\n  .mcaro__card:hover{border-color:#016FD0}\n  .mcaro__img{position:relative;padding-bottom:100%;background:#f3f5f6}\n  .mcaro__img img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}\n  .mcaro__save{position:absolute;top:10px;left:10px;background:#c8102e;color:#fff;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px;padding:3px 8px}\n  .mcaro__body{padding:12px 14px}\n  .mcaro__title{font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35;min-height:38px;margin-bottom:8px}\n  .mcaro__price{font-size:16px;font-weight:800}\n  .mcaro__price s{font-size:12.5px;color:#6b7280;font-weight:500;margin-left:6px}\n  @media(max-width:640px){.mcaro__h{font-size:24px}.mcaro__card{flex-basis:165px}}\n</style>\n\n<section class=\"mcaro\">\n  <h2 class=\"mcaro__h\">{{ heading }}</h2>\n  <div class=\"mcaro__track\">\n    {%- for p in coll.products limit: 12 -%}\n      {%- unless p.handle == current_handle -%}\n        <a class=\"mcaro__card\" href=\"{{ p.url }}\">\n          <div class=\"mcaro__img\">\n            {%- if p.compare_at_price > p.price -%}\n              {%- assign pct = p.compare_at_price | minus: p.price | times: 100 | divided_by: p.compare_at_price -%}\n              <span class=\"mcaro__save\">Save {{ pct }}%</span>\n            {%- endif -%}\n            {%- if p.featured_image -%}\n              <img src=\"{{ p.featured_image | image_url: width: 440 }}\" alt=\"{{ p.featured_image.alt | escape | default: p.title }}\" loading=\"lazy\">\n            {%- endif -%}\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mcaro__body\">\n            <div class=\"mcaro__title\">{{ p.title }}</div>\n            <div class=\"mcaro__price\">{{ p.price | money }}{%- if p.compare_at_price > p.price -%}<s>{{ p.compare_at_price | money }}</s>{%- endif -%}</div>\n          </div>\n        </a>\n      {%- endunless -%}\n    {%- endfor -%}\n  </div>\n</section>\n{%- endif -%}"
      }
    },
    "product_tabs": {
      "type": "product-tabs",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_1": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are LED bathroom mirrors safe to use in a bathroom?",
            "answer": "Yes. Our LED mirrors are **IP44 rated**, meaning they're protected against splashing water from any direction. Under UK wiring regulations (BS 7671) that makes them suitable for Zone 2 — the area around a basin — and any zone beyond it."
          }
        },
        "faq_2": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Which bathroom zone can I install it in?",
            "answer": "An IP44 rating covers **Zone 2 and outside zones** — typically above a basin or on any wall away from direct shower spray. For Zone 1 (directly above a bath or shower), an IP65 fitting is recommended. If you're unsure, position the mirror at least 60cm from the bath or shower edge."
          }
        },
        "faq_3": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do I need an electrician to fit it?",
            "answer": "If the mirror is hardwired into the mains, yes — bathroom electrical work in the UK falls under **Part P Building Regulations** and should be carried out by a qualified electrician on an RCD-protected circuit. Always check the supplied instructions for your specific model."
          }
        },
        "faq_4": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Does the demister keep the whole mirror clear?",
            "answer": "The heated demister pad sits behind the glass and keeps a generous central area clear — more than enough to shave or apply makeup straight after a hot shower. Give it a minute or two after switching on to reach full effect."
          }
        },
        "faq_5": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What's the difference between front-lit and backlit?",
            "answer": "**Front-lit** mirrors throw light forward onto your face — the best choice for detailed tasks like makeup and shaving. **Backlit** mirrors cast a soft glow around the edges for a calmer, more ambient, spa-like feel. Some designs combine both."
          }
        },
        "faq_6": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I mount it portrait or landscape?",
            "answer": "Yes — our mirrors are designed for both **vertical and horizontal** mounting, so they'll suit your space either way. Check the position of the touch control before fixing so it ends up where you want it."
          }
        },
        "faq_7": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I change the light colour?",
            "answer": "Tri-Light models let you cycle between **warm, neutral and cool white** with a tap of the touch sensor, and a memory function remembers your last setting — cool light to wake up, warmer light to wind down."
          }
        },
        "faq_8": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How does the Bluetooth work?",
            "answer": "On Bluetooth models, pair your phone or tablet to the mirror's built-in speaker to play music or podcasts while you get ready — no extra gadgets or wiring needed."
          }
        },
        "faq_9": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is the glass safe?",
            "answer": "Our mirrors use **copper-free, shatter-resistant glass**, which resists the black-edge corrosion common in steamy bathrooms and is safer if accidentally knocked."
          }
        },
        "faq_10": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long do the LEDs last and how much do they cost to run?",
            "answer": "The LEDs are rated for around **50,000 hours** and draw very little power, so they're cheap to run and you won't be replacing anything for years."
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "faq_1",
        "faq_2",
        "faq_3",
        "faq_4",
        "faq_5",
        "faq_6",
        "faq_7",
